{"id":1848909,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-27T20:17:13.228Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://aissamaissa.it/progetto/abisso-it","id":1848909,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["IT"],"original_language":"it","original_title":"L'abisso","overview":"Impressive, unforgiving and accessible through a single entrance, the Spluga della Preta plunges beneath the pastures of the Lessini Mountains in the Venetian Prealps. First explored in 1925, it was regarded as the world's deepest cave until 1953. More than any other cave, its history is intertwined with that of cave exploration, where dreams, ideals and deception have collided and new techniques have been pioneered. Its enormous shafts and narrow fissures have witnessed some of the most thrilling chapters in world speleology. In autumn 2004, a group of cavers discovers a new branch. Eighty years after the first exploration, expeditions resume in search of new passages, following air currents towards the Adige Valley. Two years of filming, 30 descents and over 70 cavers tell the fascinating story of these explorations and capture for the first time on film the Sala Nera (Black Chamber), 800 metres underground, at the bottom of one of the world's most challenging caves.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/ozRLldBKi2bFCxwL5sldkzXRcoA.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":321550,"logo_path":null,"name":"Federazione Speleologica Veneta","origin_country":""},{"id":321552,"logo_path":null,"name":"Accademia della Lessinia","origin_country":""},{"id":321553,"logo_path":null,"name":"APS Video","origin_country":""},{"id":321554,"logo_path":null,"name":"Àissa Màissa","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italy"}],"release_date":"2005-12-18","revenue":0,"runtime":75,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Italian","iso_639_1":"it","name":"Italiano"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"To ill